land Atlas","/farmland-atlas/louisiana/plaquemines-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those 75 years. On the middle of the grids, August to September 2025 came in at 42% of normal and September to October 2025 at 46%. So far in 2026, May to June published at 205% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 11262 had its driest year in 1962 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
